			"notes": "## Highlights\n\n- Added independently toggleable Duplico and Hideyho ESP modules for Safari\n- Added a global Safari ESP mode with Box + Tracer or through-wall Glow\n- Added a dedicated SAFARI ClickGUI section containing Floor Drop ESP, Duplico ESP, and Hideyho ESP\n- Added live developer diagnostics for both Safari entity detectors\n\nRequires Fabric for Minecraft `26.1.2` and Java 25.\n\nSHA-256: `3a459e62cc4b53a6e4b77d0fcd949f26847b0e1b981f2c2f23b8e7f368aa8956`"
