			"notes": "## Highlights\n\n- Player-scoped configuration, isolated credentials, and hardened lifecycle/backend synchronization\n- New Item Update Fix and Pickobulus Helper alongside tracker and HUD improvements\n- Shared responsive ClickGUI controls, color/sound pickers, and keyboard focus states\n- Hardened commands, minigames, image previews, updater installation, and network handling\n- Revisioned Hideonleaf synchronization with durable replay and backend pricing\n- Global fix for attenuated configurable alert sounds\n- Removed Blaze Auto Dagger and AutoCroesus\n\nRequires Fabric for Minecraft `26.1.2` and Java 25.\n\nSHA-256: `eedc9e9b878461369ddb5565774ab79838065e762b0bbeca45a7c4d763bf3c0a`"
		},
