			"notes": "## Minecraft 26.1.2\n\n- Ported the mod from Minecraft 1.21.11 to 26.1.2 with Java 25 and unobfuscated Mojang names.\n- Updated Fabric, rendering, GUI, networking, mixins, minigames, AutoCroesus, and all feature integrations.\n- Added Floor Drop ESP, high-class dice tracking, and related tracker updates.\n- Removed Blaze Auto Dagger and automatic weapon swapping while retaining Blaze phase displays and colored mobs.\n\nRequires Fabric Loader 0.19.3, Fabric API 0.155.2+26.1.2, Fabric Language Kotlin 1.13.13+kotlin.2.4.10, and Java 25."
